# Wrapper scopes for `SaraKinship`

> Module SaraKinshipWrappers

> Using SaraWorld as W
> Using SaraKinship as Src

Generated by `cutecat_scripts/generate_dataset.py`; edits are
overwritten. Each scope below adds no rule: it declares one input
per parameter of a top-level function of the port and returns what
that function returns. CUTECat explores one entry point per run,
and a top-level function is not one until something names it.

```catala-metadata
declaration scope FnOptDates:
  input ds content list of date
  output result content list of optional of date

declaration scope FnWindows:
  input ev content W.Event
  output result content list of Src.Window

declaration scope FnPairsFrom:
  input ev content W.Event
  input subjects content list of W.Entity
  input objects content list of W.Entity
  output result content list of Src.Kinship

declaration scope FnFlattenKinship:
  input nested content list of list of Src.Kinship
  output result content list of Src.Kinship

declaration scope FnRelates:
  input rel content list of Src.Kinship
  input subject content W.Entity
  input object content W.Entity
  output result content boolean

declaration scope FnWindowsBetween:
  input rel content list of Src.Kinship
  input subject content W.Entity
  input object content W.Entity
  output result content list of Src.Window

declaration scope FnInjectedOptDate:
  input inj content W.Injection
  input pos content integer
  output result content optional of date

declaration scope FnInjectedWindows:
  input injections content list of W.Injection
  input pred content integer
  input pattern content list of integer
  input start_pos content integer
  input end_pos content integer
  output result content list of Src.Window

declaration scope FnLatest:
  input ds content list of optional of date
  output result content optional of date

declaration scope FnEarliest:
  input ds content list of optional of date
  output result content optional of date

declaration scope FnJoinWindows:
  input a content Src.Window
  input b content Src.Window
  output result content Src.Window

declaration scope FnMarriagesOf:
  input world content W.World
  input a content W.Entity
  input b content W.Entity
  output result content list of Src.Window

declaration scope FnDatedMarriagesOf:
  input world content W.World
  input a content W.Entity
  input b content W.Entity
  output result content list of Src.Window

```

